  "content": "[Cm]\n[Fm]\n[Bb]\n[Cm]\n[Ab]\n[Bb]\n[Cm]\n[Fm]\n[Bb]\n[Cm]\n[Ab]\n[Bb]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Cm]Here I am,\n[Abmaj7]back to the wall\n[Bbsus2]I pick the fight\n[Gm]against the tide\n[Cm]Free at last, I\n[Abmaj7]go my own way\n[Bbsus2]I will resist them,\n[Am7]till the day I\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Dm]die\n[Bb]\n[C]I\n[Am]am who I am\n[Dm]\n[Bb]\n[C]My\n[Bm7b5]time has come!\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cm]I am who I am\nTake it or leave\n[Fm]it A\n[Bb]rebel at heart\n[Cm]No gods,\nno masters\n[Ab]My time has come\n[Bb]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Cm]\n[Abmaj7/C]\n[Bbsus2/C]\n[Gm/C]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Cm]There is no sacred place\n[Abmaj7]No perfect world\n[Bbsus2]Your head is home\n[Gm]Freedom in your heart\n[Cm]Be strong;\n[Abmaj7]take this chance\n[Bbsus2]Make your way,\n[Am7]a better future\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Dm]calls\n[Bb]\n[C]I\n[Am]am who I am\n[Dm]\n[Bb]\n[C]My\n[Bm7b5]time has come!\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cm]I am who I am\nTake it or leave\n[Fm]it A\n[Bb]rebel at heart\n[Cm]No gods,\nno masters\n[Ab]My time has come\n[Bb]\n[Cm]\nNo gods, no\n[Fm]masters!\n[Bb]\n[Cm]\nNo gods, no\n[Ab]masters!\n[Bb]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Cm]\nWhat doesn’t kill us\nmakes us stronger\nLocked and loaded,\nready to strike\nHere we stand,\nloud and proud,\nunited as one\nunited as one\n[Bm]\n[F#]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Bbm]\n[Ebm]\n[Ab]\n[Bbm]\n[Ebm]\n[Ab]\n[Bbm]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cm]I am who I am\nTake it or leave\n[Fm]it A\n[Bb]rebel at heart\n[Cm]No gods,\nno masters\n[Ab]My time has come\n[Bb]\n[Cm]I am who I am\nTake it or leave\n[Fm]it A\n[Bb]rebel at heart\n[Cm]No gods,\nno masters\n[Ab]My time has come\n[Bb]\n\n[Outro]\n[Ab]\n[Bb]\n[Ab/C]\n[Bb/D]\n[Ab/Eb]\n[Bb/F]\n[Cm]",
